sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: The CSMS supports security profile 3
    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: This testcase can be executed multiple times, using different kinds of invalid certificates:<br>- Unknown certificate<br>- expired certificate<br>- certificate with commonName that does not equal the serial number of the Charging Station
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State(s): N/a

    CS->>CSMS: TLS handshake: Client Hello
    CSMS-->>CS: Server Hello (with server certificate)
    CS->>CSMS: Send <Configured invalid client certificate>, Client Key Exchange, Certificate verify, Change Cipher Spec, Finished
    CSMS-->>CS: Terminate connection (client certificate deemed invalid)

    CS->>CSMS: TLS handshake: Client Hello
    CSMS-->>CS: Server Hello (with server certificate)
    CS->>CSMS: Send <Configured client certificate>, Client Key Exchange, Certificate verify, Change Cipher Spec, Finished
    CSMS-->>CS: Change Cipher Spec, Finished

    CS->>CSMS: HTTP upgrade request
    CSMS-->>CS: Upgrade connection to (secured) WebSocket connection

    CS->>CSMS: BootNotificationRequest (reason = PowerUp, chargingStation.model = <Configured model>, chargingStation.vendorName = <Configured vendorName>)
    CSMS-->>CS: BootNotificationResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: BootNotificationResponse with status Accepted

    Note over CS,CSMS: Step 13: The Test System notifies the CSMS about the current state of all connectors
    loop For each connector
        alt Message: StatusNotificationRequest
            CS->>CSMS: StatusNotificationRequest (connectorStatus = Available)
            CSMS-->>CS: StatusNotificationResponse
        else Message: NotifyEventRequest
            CS->>CSMS: NotifyEventRequest (trigger = Delta, actualValue = "Available", component.name = "Connector", variable.name = "AvailabilityState")
            CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEventResponse
        end
    end

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
